?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Vittsj%C3%B6_GIK\" title=\"Vittsjö GIK\">Vittsjö</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:87.638%;left:30.823%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Växjö\"><img alt=\"Växjö\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:70.651%;left:54.318%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Djurgården\"><img alt=\"Djurgården\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pr\" style=\"width:6em;left:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll_(women)\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll (women)\">Djurgården</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:70.706%;left:42.136%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Eskilstuna\"><img alt=\"Eskilstuna\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:71.062%;left:33.98%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Örebro\"><img alt=\"Örebro\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">Örebro</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:81.934%;left:11.199%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Göteborg\"><img alt=\"Göteborg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Göteborg</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:76.962%;left:36.973%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Linköping\"><img alt=\"Linköping\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;top:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Link%C3%B6pings_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Linköpings FC\">Linköping</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:29.004%;left:78.011%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Piteå\"><img alt=\"Piteå\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Pite%C3%A5_IF\" title=\"Piteå IF\">Piteå</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:39.385%;left:69.621%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Umeå\"><img alt=\"Umeå\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pl\" style=\"width:6em;right:5px\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/Ume%C3%A5_IK\" title=\"Umeå IK\">Umeå</a></div></div></div><div class=\"od notheme\" style=\"top:66.838%;left:50.967%;font-size:91%\"><div class=\"id\" style=\"left:-4px;top:-4px\"><span class=\"notpageimage noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Uppsala\"><img alt=\"Uppsala\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"pv\" style=\"width:6em;bottom:5px;left:-3em\"><div><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Uppsala_Fotboll\" title=\"IK Uppsala Fotboll\">Uppsala</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sweden_location_map.svg\" title=\"File:Sweden location map.svg\"> </a></div>Locations of the 2020 Damallsvenskan in <a href=\"/wiki/Sweden\" title=\"Sweden\">Sweden</a>.</div></div></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Team\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th>\n<th>Stadium\n</th>\n<th>Turf\n</th>\n<th>Stadium capacity<sup>a</sup>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Djurg%C3%A5rdens_IF_Fotboll_(women)\" title=\"Djurgårdens IF Fotboll (women)\">Djurgårdens IF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm\" title=\"Stockholm\">Stockholm</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stockholm_Olympic_Stadium\" title=\"Stockholm Olympic Stadium\">Stockholm Olympic Stadium</a>\n</td>\n<td>Natural\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">14,417\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna_United_DFF\" title=\"Eskilstuna United DFF\">Eskilstuna United DFF</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eskilstuna\" title=\"Eskilstuna\">Eskilstuna</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tunavallen\" title=\"Tunavallen\">Tunavallen</a>\n</td>\n<td>Artificial\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">7,600\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd\" title=\"FC Rosengård\">FC Rosengård</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6\" title=\"Malmö\">Malmö</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Malm%C3%B6_IP\" title=\"Malmö IP\">Malmö IP</a